:name: cepdt Nucleo-L476RG
:description: Headless boot of the cepdt Zephyr firmware on a Renode-simulated Nucleo-L476RG, UART exposed on a host pty.


using sysbus

$name?="nucleo_l476rg"
mach create $name

machine LoadPlatformDescription $repl
sysbus.flash ResetByte 0xFF

$uart_pty?="/tmp/cepdt_nucleo_l476rg_uart"

emulation CreateUartPtyTerminal "term" $uart_pty true
connector Connect sysbus.usart2 term

macro reset
"""
    sysbus LoadELF $bin
"""

runMacro $reset

start
